Allow the reviewer to record whether the relevant supporting records were inspected.

### Rules

- Financial source values must remain read-only during verification.
- Calculate differences automatically.
- Highlight discrepancies.
- Do not silently correct an opening balance.
- Record reviewer, timestamp, and verification outcome.
- A discrepancy must remain visible until investigated and resolved or formally accepted under an authorised process.
- Do not mark an account verified merely because the two values match; required supporting evidence must also have been inspected.

Provide buttons:
